[`.sedea/centers/sedea/rules/0_hosting-repo.mdc`](.sedea/centers/sedea/rules/0_hosting-repo.mdc) § *Worktree ownership*; rule **20** in [`.sedea/centers/research-and-development/rules/20_efficient-pr-shipping.mdc`](.sedea/centers/research-and-development/rules/20_efficient-pr-shipping.mdc).

